WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.959
September 14th, 2022.

00:00:02.909 --> 00:00:06.522
Officer Travis Gillespie was killed in a vehicle collision.

00:00:06.522 --> 00:00:12.306
The driver, Han Zhou, had a blood alcohol level of ninety-three milligrams per hundred millilitres.

00:00:12.306 --> 00:00:15.181
Zhou received a sentence of six years.

00:00:15.181 --> 00:00:23.090
But the collision was not the beginning of this story — it was the culmination of a psychological operations campaign targeting Canadian Forces veterans.

00:00:23.090 --> 00:00:28.170
Sergeant Wally Fong was identified through TV-PressPass as a psyops operator.

00:00:28.170 --> 00:00:35.022
Stacey Clemmer — military police and cousin to the CDA Institute network — produced wardoll targeting content.

00:00:35.022 --> 00:00:40.261
Josh Malm operated through the CDA Institute to label Canadian soldiers as enemies.

00:00:40.261 --> 00:00:45.102
Twenty-eight total counts have been filed under section 504 of the Criminal Code.

00:00:45.102 --> 00:00:49.420
Five individuals are named under section 21 as party to murder.

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:55.431
Forty-four documented child deaths at Thunderchild Residential School connect the broader institutional pattern.

00:00:55.431 --> 00:00:57.761
The network is identified.

00:00:57.761 --> 00:00:59.772
The charges are filed.

00:00:59.772 --> 00:01:01.852
The names are on the record.
